connecting with each other?

294
00:20:10,900 --> 00:20:11,800
Who cares?

295
00:20:15,220 --> 00:20:16,737
They had a great time.

296
00:20:16,820 --> 00:20:18,197
Same here.

297
00:20:18,280 --> 00:20:25,160
So I guess uh well be the best you can be.

298
00:20:26,660 --> 00:20:27,490
Thanks!

299
00:20:29,020 --> 00:20:30,820
I won't see you again, right?

300
00:20:31,120 --> 00:20:32,061
You can tell me.

301
00:20:33,080 --> 00:20:35,220
Well, my mission's complete.

302
