You wouldn't guess, but I
actually have a greedy side.

303
00:20:42,460 --> 00:20:44,695
There are tons of things I want to do.

304
00:20:45,300 --> 00:20:47,712
I can't stand the thought of missing out.

305
00:20:48,040 --> 00:20:50,628
I want to go to college
and run the company.

306
00:20:57,880 --> 00:20:58,837
And maybe...

307
00:20:58,920 --> 00:21:01,020
even fall in love, too.

308
00:21:08,860 --> 00:21:11,448
Just wanted to say
thanks for the other day.

309
00:21:11,980 --> 00:21:13,720
Shiori, your chariot awaits.

310
00:21:15,120 --> 00:21:18,520
You know, I had a whole lot
