316
00:21:48,820 --> 00:21:50,820
Or was that her just being polite?

317
00:21:51,300 --> 00:21:52,130
For real.

318
00:21:52,420 --> 00:21:53,660
It's a total mystery.

319
00:21:54,040 --> 00:21:56,277
Either way, there's no
need to rush things.

320
00:21:56,360 --> 00:21:58,831
Building any relationship takes some time.

321
00:22:00,980 --> 00:22:01,810
You're right.

322
00:22:02,560 --> 00:22:06,140
So then, how about we start
our next operation on Sunday?

323
